Firmware for scenarios/relays: the project's config with relay diversion on two relays,
D8 and D9 (surplus thresholds 1000 and 2000 W, import threshold 200 W, 2 minutes minimum
ON and OFF), and a 1-minute filter so that the scenarios stay short. The minimum times are
longer than the 1-minute settle time after any relay change, so that they can be told apart.
The override pin D4 forces every load and relay, the diversion pin is D3 and the router
OFF pin is D2 (all active LOW).

  git apply --unidiff-zero sim/configs/relays.patch
  PLATFORMIO_BUILD_DIR=.pio/build-relays pio run --project-dir Mk2_3phase_RFdatalog_temp -e basic
  git checkout Mk2_3phase_RFdatalog_temp/config.h
  make -C sim check-relays

The build directory of its own keeps the basic firmware of 'make check'.

